{"id":"ebaf7fe36df3a088","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-reflection-model-theory.md","title":"Reflection Model Theory","display":"thm-reflection-model-theory — Reflection Model Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-reflection-model-theory","aliases":["58-thm-reflection-model-theory","Reflection Theorem Model Theory","Model-Theoretic Reflection"],"display":"thm-reflection-model-theory — Reflection Model Theory","depends_on":["[[58-thm-reflection]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-v-alpha]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-reflection-model-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-reflection-model-theory</span><span>Reflection Theorem Model Theory</span><span>Model-Theoretic Reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-model-theory — Reflection Model Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dea0e944a5a296c9\" href=\"?note=dea0e944a5a296c9\" title=\"58-thm-reflection\">58-thm-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> (the first-order language of membership)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec a)\\in\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec a)\\in\\omega\\)</span> (finite tuple of set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metalinguistic satisfaction, used only to state the reflection schema)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec a)\\in\\omega\\to\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec a)\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\land\\bigl((V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec a)\\in\\omega\\to\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec a)\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\land\\bigl((V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow(V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Parameters must belong to the reflecting rank segment, and the formula on the right is relativized to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Finite sets of formulas can be reflected simultaneously; the assertion displays the one-formula instance.</li>\n<li>Because the left-hand structure has the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as its domain, the entire schema instance is metalinguistic, not merely the displayed satisfaction signs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"dea0e944a5a296c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-v-alpha","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-v-alpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)$ (formula, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"targ